  "bodyHash": "9ce6a236b30c7a73",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《永恒下界》将 Minecraft 最炽热的维度彻底点燃——把这片烈焰地狱改造成全新的战场！探索堡垒般的猪人庄园、高耸的堡垒遗迹以及阴森的地下墓穴，每一处都盘踞着凶猛的新生物，灰烬中更隐藏着强大的宝藏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">拯救盟友，击败腐化敌人，在这个比以往更加生机勃勃、也更加致命的下界中书写你的命运。全新生物、全新战利品、全新方块——当然，还有多得离谱的熔岩。带上你最棒的装备、最敏锐的反应，再备上几瓶额外的抗火药水……你绝对用得上！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新建筑</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">猪人庄园</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：深藏于绯红森林之中，这座宏伟的宅邸是身经百战的猪人与凶猛的猪人猎手的栖身之所。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">堡垒遗迹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：高耸于诡异森林之上，这座古老的哨所庇护着危险且已腐化的诡异末影人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">地下墓穴</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一座巨大的凋灵造型废墟，爬行着致命的凋灵骷髅变种——以及等待被发掘的秘密。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ 新生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">猪人猎手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 手持盾牌，并展示着猎物的战利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">猪人囚犯</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可用金锭与传说中的下界合金钟解救——并向英雄们赠送一件 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">无法破坏的下界合金盾</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">作为奖励！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">诡异末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 见人就攻击——使用剪刀分阶段净化它们！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐尸者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🗡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋灵骷髅骑士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌫️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幽魂猎手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以及 👻 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">威克斯</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 为下界的幽暗回廊带来全新挑战。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新装备与物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">下界合金钟</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：解放被囚禁猪人的必需品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">弯刀</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一款迅捷的新武器，采用复古的剑类格挡机制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">下界合金盾</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：无法破坏，且不会被重击破坏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋灵圆舞曲唱片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：为你的下界基地挖掘出诡谲的新音效。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">诡异末影珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：传送时附带抗火、缓慢降落等增益效果！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 新建筑方块</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎黑石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：完整的方块家族，包含碎裂版与装饰版变体。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎骨块</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🪵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎煤炭块</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎玄武岩</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以及 🥶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎石英块</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 方块套装。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">诡异下界砖</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：经典下界砖块的革新玩法！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌾 农业增强</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎骨粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：为你的作物注入超能力——效果远超普通骨粉！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 平台需安装由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 开发的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，命名方式为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在，具体视模组而定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izofar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Izofar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 最初创作了出色的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bygone Nether</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组。本模组忠实延续了其作品，并在此基础上进行了部分新增、优化、重构与漏洞修复。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 创作了大量精彩的全新贴图。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/metal-bundles\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
